To get started reproducing the analyses in this file, open the file named `SupplementalMaterials.Rnw' (the title will include the last date of modification), and set your working directory to the location of the files. There are many ways to do this --- an easy one is to adjust line 97 (wdpath = ...) in the .Rnw file to match the location of the directory on your own computer.

